mories. So help me!\"\n\nIn order to survive as the greatest doctor, I need the greatest person to protect me! My dad!\nWake up, dad!\n\n===\n\nI signed a contract with my dad in exchange for helping him find his memories.\n\nOn the way, I helped out a girl, as well as my younger uncle.\n\nWhile also saving my big uncle, and cousin.\n\n\"I'm going home!\"\n\"No, don't go, Big sis!\"\n\"My daughter's crying, so I forbid you from leaving.\"\n\"I'm going!\"\n\nOh my goodness!\nEveryone’s trying to make me stay.\n\nBut I’m dead set on throwing everything away and leaving!\n\nCan I really stay away for long?","year":2024,"status":"completed","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Historical","Romance","Isekai","Medical","Fantasy"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/8e0bab9b-162d-437b-866f-3d2bdc70710c/209dcc83-4638-4858-a698-18f88bd5d434.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ko","availableLanguages":["fr","en"],"lane":"manhwa","rating":8.46,"follows":449,"listAt":"2026-10-20T13:04:05.189Z","chapters":[{"id":"7c2a6685-b9ea-4fe5-b3f2-ac74568a7b49","number":null,"volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":12,"createdAt":"2024-09-16T04:32:35+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"d59222ae-5fc7-4760-b121-95b95f85ff88","number":null,"volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":13,"createdAt":"2024-11-28T21:04:47+00:00","baked":false}],"chapterCount":2,"chaptersAt":"2026-10-19T10:31:57.725Z"},"dc132107-12de-4dd1-b896-09b18b9ed81f":{"id":"dc132107-12de-4dd1-b896-09b18b9ed81f","title":"My Favorite Savior Girl","altTitle":"My Favorite salvation girl","description":"[Translated by Mystic Willow Scans] As Lee Yeo-ju hums a song that comforted her during her long hospital stay, she is approached by an idol star named Park Jae-ha, whom she has only seen in videos. \"I'll help you. You need money for the surgery, right?\" Jae-ha becomes Yeo-ju's savior and favorite. However, five years later, he ends his life by making an extreme choice... Yeo-ju, in shock, cries out to a shooting star to save him. Did her wish come true? She goes back seven years and possesses the body of Jang Bo-ran, a top idol at the time and a judge on the audition program \"I Am the Strongest Idol\"... Among the audition participants is trainee Park Jae-ha!\"Just like you saved me, I will save you this time.\"","year":2023,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Romance","Drama"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/dc132107-12de-4dd1-b896-09b18b9ed81f/ec72cd5b-8fa9-4c9a-9033-20fe42925a2e.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ko","availableLanguages":["en","pl"],"lane":"manhwa","rating":8.14,"follows":592,"listAt":"2026-10-20T13:04:05.190Z","chapters":[{"id":"10126dd0-0400-4fd7-bdd5-ab9606f2dfdd","number":"70","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":73,"createdAt":"2026-01-07T17:44:55+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"8508fd50-1831-4203-803e-caddc3dc24c9","number":"69","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":14,"createdAt":"2026-01-07T17:44:19+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"e5621393-b259-4ea1-bf28-26c3f2ea2ab1","number":"68","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":71,"createdAt":"2026-01-07T17:43:49+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"330b3eb2-f05d-497c-b006-1bf8791906d5","number":"67","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":81,"createdAt":"2026-01-07T17:42:53+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"3ed0cd49-b35b-426c-9162-304ea9ea348d","number":"66","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":71,"createdAt":"2026-01-07T17:42:06+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"6a3cb314-a0ba-4eb2-a11e-220f8171b846","number":"65","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":66,"createdAt":"2026-01-07T17:41:05+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"759f1fcf-a4f6-4b8c-9d51-25f57199cca3","number":"64","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":67,"createdAt":"2026-01-07T17:40:22+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"7483b1ed-575c-477e-9aba-70bddd56ff2a","number":"63","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":51,"createdAt":"2026-01-07T17:39:35+00:00","bak